sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant LG as Load Generator
    participant MS as Microservices (Online Boutique)
    participant PROM as Prometheus
    participant GRAF as Grafana Cloud
    participant ALERT as Alerting Engine
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant LLM as LLM (AI Analysis)
    participant ADMIN as System Administrator

    %% Normal operation
    LG->>MS: Generate traffic (user requests)
    MS->>PROM: Expose metrics (latency, errors, CPU)
    PROM->>GRAF: Send metrics

    %% Increased load
    LG->>MS: Spike in traffic
    MS-->>MS: Resource exhaustion / failure
    MS->>PROM: Increased error rate (5xx), latency ↑

    %% Detection
    PROM->>GRAF: Updated metrics
    GRAF->>ALERT: Evaluate alert rules
    ALERT->>ALERT: Threshold exceeded
    ALERT->>MCP: Trigger alert with context

    %% AI analysis
    MCP->>LLM: Provide metrics + logs + context
    LLM->>MCP: Root cause analysis

    Note over LLM: "High load caused<br/>cartservice latency spike<br/>possible CPU bottleneck"

    MCP->>ADMIN: Explanation + recommendations

    %% Human interaction
    ADMIN->>MCP: Ask follow-up question (natural language)
    MCP->>LLM: Retrieve deeper insights
    LLM->>ADMIN: Suggested actions:
    Note over LLM: - Scale service<br/>- Check resource limits<br/>- Inspect logs

    %% Optional resolution
    ADMIN->>MS: Apply fix (scale / config change)